 "notes": "Region is not checked. The private tier is off by default, so its EIPs, NAT gateways, route tables, routes, S3 endpoint and SG rule are checked as declared, count-gated blocks; the gate (or, as a fallback, the block's text) must mention 'private'. ecr_sg_egress_vpc_only fails a group with no egress at all (in Terraform that allows no egress). A single S3 endpoint shared by public and private route tables does not satisfy the 'dedicated private gateway endpoint'. param_private_cidrs cannot tell a null default from a variable with no default. The ECR ingress checks require a TCP rule (HTTPS), so an all-protocol rule does not count. The inline branch of ecr_sg_ingress_private_conditional needs the private-CIDR ingress to be conditional (a dynamic ingress block, or a null/ternary test next to the private CIDRs), not just any ingress mentioning private."
}